---
/* Starlight server-renders `<html data-theme="dark">` in Page.astro and leaves
   it to this component to correct from localStorage and prefers-color-scheme.
   Emptying ThemeSelect removes the control but not the behaviour: without this
   override a visitor on a dark-preferring machine still gets the dark palette.

   Expressive Code keys its light style variant off `[data-theme='light']` too,
   so code blocks depend on this and not only on the custom properties.

   Inline and in `<head>`, so it runs before first paint. */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "light";
</script>
